#: appPlugins/ToolCutOut.py:3220
msgid ""
"Number of gaps used for the Automatic cutout.\n"
"There can be maximum 8 bridges/gaps.\n"
"LR/TB use left-right or top-bottom center anchors; 2LR/2TB use quarter "
"anchors.\n"
"4 means two LR plus two TB gaps; 8 means four LR plus four TB gaps.\n"
"Each contour must fit the exact count and width or the operation fails.\n"
"The choices are:\n"
"- None  - no gaps\n"
"- lr    - left + right\n"
"- tb    - top + bottom\n"
"- 4     - left + right +top + bottom\n"
"- 2lr   - 2*left + 2*right\n"
"- 2tb  - 2*top + 2*bottom\n"
"- 8     - 2*left + 2*right +2*top + 2*bottom"
msgstr ""
"用于自动切割的缺口数量。\n"
"最多可有 8 个桥接/缺口。\n"
"LR/TB 使用左右或上下中心锚点；2LR/2TB 使用四分之一锚点。\n"
"4 表示两个 LR 加两个 TB 缺口；8 表示四个 LR 加四个 TB 缺口。\n"
"每个轮廓必须恰好容纳该数量和宽度，否则操作失败。\n"
"可选项为：\n"
"- 无    - 无缺口\n"
"- lr    - 左 + 右\n"
"- tb    - 上 + 下\n"
"- 4     - 左 + 右 + 上 + 下\n"
"- 2lr   - 2*左 + 2*右\n"
"- 2tb  - 2*上 + 2*下\n"
"- 8     - 2*左 + 2*右 + 2*上 + 2*下"

